      "date": "2026-11-15 17:20:10.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 2:\n\n(2 comments)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nThe code change looks correct: the new admin_nodemap waits are only skipped when admin was already 1, which is exactly the case where nothing changes. Some questions on the commit message inline about whether this covers the SSK failures in the ticket. Separately, and not part of this patch: fileset_test_setup() and multi_fileset_test_setup() also set admin=1 and trusted=1 but only wait for trusted_nodemap, so they seem to have the same race. A follow-up change could fix them.",
